# ── SECRETS — NEVER commit these ───────────────────────────────────
# Gemini + Supabase + X keys live here. Rotating a leaked key takes
# minutes; explaining to your supervisor why they showed up in a public
# repo takes longer.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.env
!.env.example
!.env.sample

# Supabase / other auth
**/credentials.json
**/service-account*.json

